{
  "about": "Which required capabilities each known tool covers, by the family of its source (TOOLS_SPEC.md). A family is matched by its server's serverInfo name or endpoint name; soness's own tools are the acp, local and builtin families. Unknown tools cover nothing and are offered as extras. A family's groups tier its tools when a session has many (zio-typesafe-ai's ToolGroup): a grouped tool is offered as its group until the decision model opens it; the ungrouped ones (what most requests need) are always offered.",
